{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"La Piñata Taqueria | 加州瓦列霍的塔可餐车与墨西哥卷饼","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LP</span><span>La Piñata Taqueria</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"menu/\">菜单</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a><a href=\"#gallery\">照片</a><a href=\"#reviews\">评价</a><a href=\"#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">点餐</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/hero-tacos.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">塔可餐车 · 809 Broadway · 瓦列霍</p>\n    <h1>La Piñata Taqueria</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Broadway 上的这辆黄色塔可餐车，入选了《旧金山纪事报》湾区最佳墨西哥卷饼榜单。酥脆的 suadero 牛肉、两款超赞的莎莎酱，还有分量十足的超级卷饼。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.7 · Google 上的 276 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 来电提前点餐</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 导航</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>Yelp 全美百佳餐车第 6 名（2025）</li><li>入选《旧金山纪事报》最佳卷饼榜单</li><li>外带、电话订餐和外烩</li><li>户外野餐桌</li><li>周一至周五 11 点至 9 点营业</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">我们的餐车</p><h2>新鲜食材，浓郁风味，价格公道。</h2><p>La Piñata 是一辆停在 809 Broadway 的黄色餐车（lonchera），用新鲜优质的食材制作正宗墨西哥美食：塔可、墨西哥三明治、芝士薄饼、玉米片、超级卷饼和虾类菜品，还有 horchata 米浆饮和洛神花水。</p><p>2025 年，Yelp 在其历来全美百佳餐车榜单中将我们排在第 6 名；2022 年 11 月，《旧金山纪事报》也把我们列入湾区最佳墨西哥卷饼榜单。有些顾客甚至专程从旧金山开车过来。</p><div class=\"facts\"><div class=\"fact\"><b>#6</b><span>Yelp 全美百佳餐车</span></div><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.7★</b><span>276 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>周一–周五</b><span>上午 11 点至晚上 9 点</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/tacos.jpg\" alt=\"一盘 La Piñata 街头塔可\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"menu\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">菜单</p><h2>今日菜单</h2><p>塔可、超级卷饼、墨西哥三明治、玉米片和芝士薄饼。</p></div><div class=\"menu-cards\"><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tacos\"><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"一盘 La Piñata 塔可，配香菜、洋葱、萝卜和胡萝卜\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>塔可 Tacos</h3><ul><li><span>塔可 Taco</span><b>$3.50</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-burritos\"><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"铺在锡纸上切开的 La Piñata 超级卷饼\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>卷饼 Burritos</h3><ul><li><span>超级卷饼 Super Burrito</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>超级素食卷饼</span><b>$14</b></li><li><span>超级鲜虾卷饼</span><b>$18</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">还有 1 项</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\"><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"La Piñata 的玉米片、红绿莎莎酱、腌胡萝卜和一根烤墨西哥辣椒\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>墨西哥三明治、玉米片和芝士薄饼</h3><ul><li><span>墨西哥三明治 Torta</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>超级玉米片 Super Nachos</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>超级芝士薄饼 Super Quesadilla</span><b>$16</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-drinks\"><div><h3>饮料</h3><ul><li><span>罐装汽水</span><b>$2</b></li><li><span>墨西哥汽水</span><b>$3</b></li><li><span>瓶装水</span><b>$1</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">还有 1 项</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-extras\"><div><h3>加料</h3><ul><li><span>塔可加芝士、酸奶油或牛油果</span><b>$0.25</b></li><li><span>卷饼加芝士、酸奶油或牛油果</span><b>$1</b></li></ul></div></a></div><div class=\"cta-row menu-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"menu/\">查看完整菜单和价格 →</a></div><div class=\"menu-source\"><p>价格可能会有变动。</p></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>来之前须知</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>外带</b><span>餐点包装整齐，方便带走</span></li><li><b>电话订餐</b><span>提前来电，免去排队</span></li><li><b>外烩服务</b><span>欢迎致电餐车咨询</span></li><li><b>现金或刷卡</b><span>刷卡可能会收取少量手续费</span></li><li><b>路边停车</b></li><li><b>户外座位</b><span>野餐桌</span></li><li><b>周五晚上 6 点左右最忙</b><span>可能需要等候约 15 分钟</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>餐车现做</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"一盘塔可，配香菜、洋葱、萝卜、胡萝卜和青柠\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>塔可</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-plate.jpg\" alt=\"盘中的超级卷饼，配腌胡萝卜和一杯 horchata\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>超级卷饼</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"玉米片、红绿莎莎酱、腌胡萝卜和一根烤墨西哥辣椒\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>玉米片、莎莎酱和腌菜</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"铺在锡纸上切开的卷饼\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>卷饼</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-closeup.jpg\" alt=\"卷饼特写，里面有肉、米饭和芝士\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>卷饼</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-foil.jpg\" alt=\"锡纸包着、咬了一口的卷饼\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>外带卷饼</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">媒体报道</p><h2>荣誉与报道</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Our latest obsession is this taco truck. Service is always awesome, employees are always pleasant, and service is fast. Today they packed our food [chicken tacos and super carne asada burritos] with everything extra: plenty of red and green salsa, chips and extra grilled onion/jalapeno. Everything was delicious.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Yelp Top 100 Food Trucks in the US 2025 (#6)</b> · Yelp Elite Carla G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/article/top-100-food-trucks-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“A Suadero Super Burrito from La Piñata might be one of the best things to eat in Vallejo — it’s in the top five at least.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>San Francisco Chronicle</b> · Top Burritos in the Bay Area, Nov 2022</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>值得专程来一趟</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.7</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 276 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 438 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Yelp 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“suadero super burrito 10/10 would recommend. best burrito i’ve had in a minute! my sister got a al pastor taco which was a also very good. solid salsa (red one is sooo good) and food comes with pickles veggies which i love. also jamaica and horchata are both great. the horchata has a little coconut flavor. we live in the city and this beats out the options there. i’d consider driving up for this food tysm &lt;3”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“La Piñata has been my favorite taco truck in Vallejo for years. Even after moving away, I still compare every taco spot to this one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Henry D. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“This is by far the best burrito place in Vallejo hands down. In every bite of my steak and shrimp burrito you can taste the freshness of all the ingredients. He always gives me a free drink when I come. I can appreciate that level of consistent exceptional customer service. Highly Recommended La Piñata !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I came here after hearing such great things about La Pinata&#39;s suadero burritos, and they did not disappoint at all! This is a food truck with incredibly kind, hardworking staff…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Lynn N. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“La Piñata is so good. I come from San Francisco for it and always get it when I’m in the area. The owner and staff have amazing customer service and the food is always good and fresh. I don’t usually leave reviews but it’s worth it. My go to is the chicken and shrimp burrito and the steak and shrimp nachos. Chefs kiss!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Monster sized burritos, satisfying eats, actual REAL avocado slices instead of weird guacamole, lots and lots of outdoor seating, plus, ...wait for it.....access to an INDOOR restroom…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Echosaisis A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Easily the best Taqueria in Vallejo NGL 🔥 2 Super Steak Burritos w/everything 2 Tacos-1 asada, 1 carnitas Didn&#39;t have to ask for extra sauce , customer service was A+ . 50 min drive was 100% worth it, will def be back”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I got their lengua, cabeza and carnitas tacos. The most was so tender and flavorful. I don&#39;t feel like many do their lengua well, but theirs are definitely one of my favorites. Their salsas are both really good and have a lot of flavor.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I really like to this place. I mean it&#39;s just a taco trailer but the food was good and hardy. The service was quick. And the guy running the thing was pretty nice.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>可以提前打电话点餐吗？</summary><p>可以！请拨打 (707) 334-8381 提前点餐，免去排队。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间是什么时候？</summary><p>我们周一至周五上午 11 点至晚上 9 点营业，周六和周日休息。</p></details><details><summary>可以刷卡吗？</summary><p>可以，我们收现金也可以刷卡。刷卡可能会收取少量手续费。</p></details><details><summary>推荐点什么？</summary><p>试试 suadero 超级卷饼，就是《旧金山纪事报》特别推荐的那款。我们的 al pastor（腌猪肉）、牛舌、carnitas（手撕猪肉）和鲜虾卷饼也很受欢迎。</p></details><details><summary>提供外烩服务吗？</summary><p>提供。欢迎致电餐车咨询。</p></details><details><summary>有座位和停车位吗？</summary><p>我们有户外野餐桌，停车主要是路边停车。</p></details><details><summary>什么时候人最多？</summary><p>周五晚上 6 点左右人最多，可能需要等候约 15 分钟。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">欢迎光临</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和地址</h2>\n      <address>809 Broadway<br>Vallejo, CA 94590</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">(707) 334-8381</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>休息</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">周末休息。可用现金或刷卡（刷卡可能会收取少量手续费）。提供外烩服务，欢迎来电咨询。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/640168939444142\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0